<title>FINLAND: ALFRED BERG BROKERS BIG OUTOKUMPU TRADE.</title>
<headline>ALFRED BERG BROKERS BIG OUTOKUMPU TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage Alfred Berg on Tuesday crossed internally 1,084,000 shares in metals and mining group Outokumpu on the Helsinki Stock Exchange at 103.50 markka, up 0.50 markka.</p>
<p>Owners of over one million shares in Outokumpu, according to its 1996 annual report, are: the state, the social insurance institution, insurers Ilmarinen and Varma, Outokumpu's pension foundations and the local governments' pension fund.</p>
<p>Outokumpu had no comment on the deal and Alfred Berg declined to comment it.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
